{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"90882cf6-8dd5-4874-a8e8-b124efe035ca","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Fixed the concurrent lease race, SQLite partial-commit leak, retry/DLQ lifecycle, and backoff jitter bugs across all four modules:\n\n- [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795157926758_baseline/models.py): Implemented `validate_transition` with the allowed state transition table (raising `InvalidTransitionError` on disallowed transitions), added `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` to `Job`, and enforced attempt and lease invariants in `Job.__post_init__`.\n- [retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795157926758_baseline/retry.py): Updated `compute_backoff` to validate non-boolean, non-negative `attempt`, `base`, and `cap`, handle large `attempt` values without `OverflowError`, and return seeded full-jitter exponential backoff in `[0.0, cap]`.\n- [queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795157926758_baseline/queue_store.py): Configured `QueueStore._connect` with `isolation_level=None` and wrapped `claim_next_job`, `complete_job`, `fail_job`, and `reclaim_expired_leases` in explicit `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` / `COMMIT` / `ROLLBACK` transactions; fixed `_row_to_job` to populate `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at`; ensured `complete_job` and `fail_job` verify lease ownership and roll back all changes (including audit rows) on any error.\n- [worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_1795157926758_baseline/worker.py): Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` to reclaim expired leases, compute seeded backoff via `compute_backoff` on handler exceptions, and call `store.fail_job`; updated `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` to wait for scheduled retries and active running jobs when `wait_for_retry=True`.\n\n**Verification**:\n- `python -m pytest -q`: `1 passed in 0.12s`\n- Verified `validate_transition`, `compute_backoff` (including large `attempt` and `bool` rejection), 8-thread concurrent `claim_next_job` exclusivity, `complete_job` rollback on `pre_status_hook` failure, `reclaim_expired_leases`, and `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` DLQ routing.\n","duration_seconds":95.8432034,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":53293,"output_tokens":12680,"thinking_tokens":3414,"cache_read_tokens":265818,"total_tokens":65973}}}
